WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:02:03.570
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
02:03.840 --> 02:04.400
Police.

3
02:04.719 --> 02:05.319
Hello.

4
02:06.159 --> 02:07.480
Where's Jiang Shan's office?

5
02:07.840 --> 02:08.639
It's upstairs.

6
02:10.439 --> 02:11.560
Take some men to the security room.

7
02:11.680 --> 02:12.080
Copy that.

8
02:12.759 --> 02:13.680
You guard the lobby.

9
02:13.840 --> 02:14.240
Got it.

10
02:14.439 --> 02:15.159
Please take me there.

11
02:15.319 --> 02:15.759
Okay.

12
02:16.280 --> 02:16.960
Follow me.

13
02:17.680 --> 02:18.719
Which way to the security room?

14
02:18.879 --> 02:19.680
This way.

15
02:39.360 --> 02:40.479
Who are you people?

16
02:42.280 --> 02:42.919
Police.

17
02:43.599 --> 02:44.360
Where's Jiang Shan?

18
02:45.639 --> 02:46.360
He just stepped out.

19
02:46.560 --> 02:47.280
Stepped out?

20
02:49.439 --> 02:50.759
Where did he go? When?

21
02:51.599 --> 02:52.479
I'm not really sure.

22
02:59.960 --> 03:00.800
Police! Don't move!

23
03:01.000 --> 03:01.680
Stop! Freeze!

24
03:03.560 --> 03:05.240
Police! Freeze! Don't move!

25
03:10.560 --> 03:11.039
Stop!

26
03:12.560 --> 03:13.199
Stop running!

27
03:18.639 --> 03:19.759
We're from Municipal Public Security.

28
03:20.280 --> 03:22.599
Some of you are suspected of a crime.

29
03:22.879 --> 03:24.039
We are making lawful arrests.

30
03:24.800 --> 03:27.319
Please cooperate with our investigation.

31
03:29.439 --> 03:30.360
Where's your captain?

32
03:34.719 --> 03:35.240
Captain.

33
03:44.159 --> 03:45.919
Take this phone to the info center now

34
03:46.039 --> 03:46.599
and get it decrypted.

35
03:46.719 --> 03:47.080
Yes, sir.

36
03:51.199 --> 03:52.120
Move, move!

37
03:53.560 --> 03:54.120
Captain Shen.

38
03:54.960 --> 03:56.439
Jiang Hua just left with the suspect.

39
03:56.840 --> 03:58.319
Jiang Shan has left the company as well.

40
03:58.560 --> 03:59.439
They're probably both

41
03:59.599 --> 04:00.520
on the run right now.

42
04:00.639 --> 04:01.000
Understood.

43
04:01.319 --> 04:02.560
I'll head to the surveillance room

44
04:02.560 --> 04:03.280
to check the vehicle logs.

45
04:03.360 --> 04:03.960
Wait for my word.

46
04:04.000 --> 04:04.479
Copy that.

47
04:20.279 --> 04:22.839
Bro, did you leave something behind?

48
04:24.680 --> 04:28.160
Left in such a hurry, I forgot a phone.

49
04:29.639 --> 04:32.959
Forget it. I won't need it anyway.

50
04:34.920 --> 04:38.439
We're never coming back to Nanhai.

51
04:39.399 --> 04:42.000
Bro, aren't we leaving a bit too quickly?

52
04:42.480 --> 04:44.319
We didn't really need to run, did we?

53
04:45.000 --> 04:46.160
You idiot...

54
04:46.720 --> 04:49.600
Stop obsessing over your Nanhai perks.

55
04:50.000 --> 04:52.560
Cheng Weimin was caught by the police.

56
04:53.519 --> 04:54.759
The moment he confesses,

57
04:54.959 --> 04:56.079
not just us,

58
04:56.959 --> 04:59.480
all of Piyazi's mainland channels

59
04:59.920 --> 05:02.439
will fall under police investigation.

60
05:02.639 --> 05:05.959
I bet the punk has already talked.

61
05:06.800 --> 05:08.079
He's just one Cheng Weimin.

62
05:09.160 --> 05:10.680
The boss can't find a way to take him out?

63
05:11.720 --> 05:12.720
Take him out how?

64
05:13.399 --> 05:15.279
Storm the police station with a dozen guys

65
05:15.439 --> 05:16.600
and take Cheng Weimin out?

66
05:17.720 --> 05:20.240
You watch too many crime movies.

67
05:25.079 --> 05:27.240
I have a really bad feeling today.

68
05:28.199 --> 05:32.519
I feel like a massive storm is coming.

69
05:35.439 --> 05:36.600
So what do we do now?

70
05:37.360 --> 05:38.079
Here's the plan.

71
05:38.959 --> 05:42.319
There's 5 million in cash in the trunk.

72
05:43.360 --> 05:44.920
You guys split it up in a bit.

73
06:11.279 --> 06:13.040
Attention all units. Attention all units.

74
06:13.319 --> 06:16.839
The suspect is in a black Mercedes van,

75
06:16.920 --> 06:21.399
license plate Nan A688B7, Nan A688B7,

76
06:21.480 --> 06:22.279
fleeing the scene.

77
06:22.600 --> 06:24.600
According to traffic control,

78
06:24.759 --> 06:27.439
the suspect vehicle is heading towards

79
06:27.600 --> 06:28.519
the High-Tech Zone via Dongfeng Bridge.

80
06:28.759 --> 06:30.480
All units in the vicinity,

81
06:30.639 --> 06:32.040
search the area immediately.

82
06:32.240 --> 06:34.720
Report immediately if you spot the vehicle.

83
06:36.439 --> 06:38.040
Suspect vehicle spotted on Zhazi Street!

84
06:38.199 --> 06:38.920
Requesting backup!

85
07:01.160 --> 07:02.720
From Zhazi Street to Yong'an Road,

86
07:02.720 --> 07:03.720
once they cross Dongfeng Bridge,

87
07:03.879 --> 07:05.560
they can enter the High-Tech Zone,

88
07:05.920 --> 07:08.399
and then get onto Rong'an Expressway.

89
07:09.160 --> 07:11.680
If they head northwest from Yong'an Road,

90
07:11.720 --> 07:13.000
they can get onto the Ring Expressway,

91
07:13.199 --> 07:15.040
and finally take the Yupei Expressway.

92
07:17.920 --> 07:20.160
Xiang Nan, Ma Jingrong, Four-Legged Snake,

93
07:20.240 --> 07:21.639
and guys like Huang Weiguang

94
07:22.040 --> 07:23.560
have all operated in Chang'an before.

95
07:23.800 --> 07:25.600
The route the suspects know best

96
07:25.759 --> 07:27.959
should be the escape route from Chang'an.

97
07:29.560 --> 07:32.240
They will likely cross Dongfeng Bridge

98
07:33.519 --> 07:34.839
and head straight into the High-Tech Zone.

99
07:36.040 --> 07:37.800
Units near Yong'an Road, listen up.

100
07:38.000 --> 07:39.480
Units near Yong'an Road,

101
07:39.680 --> 07:41.560
find a way to tail the suspect vehicle.

102
07:42.319 --> 07:43.879
Attention, units near the High-Tech Zone.

103
07:44.120 --> 07:46.839
Get ready to intercept on Dongfeng Bridge.

104
07:46.959 --> 07:49.279
Get ready to intercept on Dongfeng Bridge.

105
07:49.560 --> 07:50.560
Guan Qiang, Guan Qiang.

106
07:50.879 --> 07:53.199
Keep us posted on the suspect's movements.

107
08:19.959 --> 08:21.759
Hurry! The cops are catching up!

108
09:43.440 --> 09:45.120
The suspect vehicle is on Dongfeng Bridge.

109
09:45.519 --> 09:46.799
Our team can't intercept them in time.

110
09:48.399 --> 09:50.279
If they cross Dongfeng Bridge,

111
09:50.320 --> 09:51.360
it's an area with heavy traffic

112
09:51.519 --> 09:52.600
and dense crowds.

113
09:52.799 --> 09:53.600
If that happens,

114
09:53.759 --> 09:54.799
it'll be very difficult to make the arrest.

115
09:55.440 --> 09:56.960
We won't have enough time.

116
09:58.519 --> 09:59.279
Guan Qiang! Guan Qiang!

117
09:59.480 --> 10:01.240
Report the suspect's current location.

118
10:15.000 --> 10:15.840
Guan Qiang, Guan Qiang!

119
10:16.320 --> 10:16.960
Are you okay?

120
10:17.080 --> 10:18.120
What's your status?

121
10:19.480 --> 10:21.080
Guan Qiang, what's your status?

122
10:22.000 --> 10:24.080
Guan Qiang, Guan Qiang, do you copy?

123
10:24.360 --> 10:25.519
What's your situation?

124
10:26.240 --> 10:27.159
Guan Qiang, Guan Qiang!

125
10:27.320 --> 10:28.639
Come in, respond!

126
10:29.799 --> 10:33.559
They're halfway across Dongfeng Bridge.

127
10:34.600 --> 10:35.799
Don't worry, Captain Shen.

128
10:36.600 --> 10:39.039
I won't let them get away.

129
11:43.279 --> 11:43.879
Get out of the car.

130
12:30.200 --> 12:30.600
Get out of the car!

131
12:30.600 --> 12:31.279
Don't shoot! Don't shoot!

132
12:31.919 --> 12:33.360
Zhao Ming! Zhao Ming!

133
12:33.559 --> 12:34.600
Check on Guan Qiang!

134
12:39.840 --> 12:40.320
Guan Qiang!

135
12:43.120 --> 12:43.600
Guan Qiang!

136
12:44.480 --> 12:45.080
Guan Qiang!

137
12:49.000 --> 12:49.600
Guan Qiang!

138
12:52.039 --> 12:52.720
Guan Qiang!

139
12:55.720 --> 12:56.360
Where's Jiang Shan?

140
12:56.559 --> 12:57.440
He got out halfway!

141
12:57.519 --> 12:58.480
I don't know where he went either!

142
12:59.200 --> 12:59.840
Cuff him!

143
13:05.159 --> 13:05.799
Guan Qiang!

144
13:06.080 --> 13:06.960
How's Guan Qiang?

145
13:35.440 --> 13:36.879
Captain Shen! Captain Shen!

146
13:37.200 --> 13:38.519
Jiang Shan's most recent call

147
13:38.559 --> 13:39.919
was to the airline booking center.

148
13:40.240 --> 13:41.840
Jiang Shan booked a flight for 12:35,

149
13:42.039 --> 13:43.080
heading to Sydney.

150
13:43.960 --> 13:46.559
Zhao Ming, notify the airport checkpoint

151
13:46.559 --> 13:47.320
to detain Jiang Shan.

152
13:47.639 --> 13:48.440
Handle the scene here.

153
13:49.039 --> 13:49.919
I'm heading to the airport.

154
14:05.759 --> 14:06.480
Guan Qiang,

155
14:12.679 --> 14:16.960
passenger on Hainan Airlines Flight HU986

156
14:17.039 --> 14:18.399
bound for Sydney,

157
14:18.759 --> 14:20.519
boarding has now begun.

158
14:31.320 --> 14:32.279
Coming through, make way!

159
14:32.360 --> 14:32.919
Out of the way!

160
14:33.480 --> 14:33.960
Move aside!

161
14:34.840 --> 14:36.120
Official police business!

162
14:42.120 --> 14:43.120
Excuse me, police.

163
14:43.679 --> 14:45.399
Has today's flight to Sydney departed yet?

164
14:45.840 --> 14:46.720
It's already taken off.

165
15:02.519 --> 15:03.440
Reporting, Director Huang.

166
15:04.000 --> 15:05.240
The plane Jiang Shan boarded,

167
15:05.399 --> 15:07.080
the flight to Sydney has already taken off.

168
15:07.480 --> 15:07.919
Director Huang,

169
15:08.919 --> 15:10.840
it has a layover in Hong Kong, China.

170
15:10.919 --> 15:11.759
We still have a chance.

171
15:12.159 --> 15:13.639
I'll report to higher-ups

172
15:14.120 --> 15:16.240
ask Hong Kong, China Customs to stop him.

173
15:17.039 --> 15:18.080
But you must realize,

174
15:18.759 --> 15:20.480
his case is still under investigation.

175
15:20.799 --> 15:22.360
He isn't listed as a wanted fugitive yet.

176
15:23.600 --> 15:24.480
We can only do our best.

177
15:24.799 --> 15:27.440
The outcome is beyond our control.

178
15:28.559 --> 15:29.159
I understand.

179
15:29.399 --> 15:30.200
Also,

180
15:31.679 --> 15:32.960
I heard Comrade Guan Qiang

181
15:33.440 --> 15:35.320
was killed in today's operation.

182
15:35.720 --> 15:38.080
Ensure the aftermath is handled properly.

183
15:38.559 --> 15:39.320
Understood.

184
16:12.279 --> 16:15.440
Comrade Guan Qiang was killed in action.

185
16:21.320 --> 16:21.799
Okay.

186
16:23.639 --> 16:24.759
I understand.

187
16:27.360 --> 16:28.000
Okay.

188
16:41.559 --> 16:42.240
Lu Wei.

189
16:45.440 --> 16:46.159
What's wrong?

190
16:49.039 --> 16:52.799
In today's operation to arrest Jiang Shan,

191
16:56.320 --> 16:57.360
Guan Qiang was killed in action.

192
17:09.519 --> 17:10.720
Did you catch Jiang Shan?

193
17:14.960 --> 17:15.680
No.

194
17:49.200 --> 17:50.200
After working so hard for so long,

195
17:50.519 --> 17:51.720
Jiang Shan still got away.

196
17:52.119 --> 17:53.240
The real tragedy is Guan Qiang.

197
17:55.799 --> 17:56.440
Captain Shen.

198
17:58.079 --> 17:59.000
The boarding records show

199
17:59.160 --> 18:00.759
Jiang Shan didn't board after security.

200
18:01.480 --> 18:02.920
We've also contacted the airport police.

201
18:03.319 --> 18:04.839
They'll fully cooperate with us.

202
18:06.240 --> 18:07.400
Seal off all the exits.

203
18:07.960 --> 18:08.799
Launch a full manhunt for Jiang Shan.

204
18:08.839 --> 18:09.839
Understood. Yes, sir!

205
18:33.559 --> 18:34.200
Jiang Shan

206
19:04.359 --> 19:07.839
I met Cheng Weimin five years ago.

207
19:08.079 --> 19:11.480
My business failed, and foolishly,

208
19:12.640 --> 19:16.279
I teamed up with him to traffic drugs.

209
19:17.759 --> 19:21.839
We only sourced from small dealers then.

210
19:22.720 --> 19:25.200
Later, we expanded our downlines

211
19:25.680 --> 19:27.359
and wanted to scale up the business.

212
19:30.039 --> 19:30.920
Three years ago,

213
19:31.480 --> 19:33.640
Director Huang, it has started.

214
19:34.720 --> 19:37.799
we got a direct supply from Jiechan State.

215
19:39.160 --> 19:42.079
But to really make it big,

216
19:43.039 --> 19:46.519
we needed logistics, transit,

217
19:46.680 --> 19:49.200
money laundering, and all the channels.

218
19:50.039 --> 19:53.960
When I went to Nanhai to expand downlines,

219
19:54.319 --> 19:57.000
by chance, I got into Longze Group.

220
19:58.759 --> 19:59.720
A guy like me...

221
20:00.000 --> 20:02.720
my biggest strength is handling people.

222
20:03.720 --> 20:05.240
So my career at Longze

223
20:05.400 --> 20:07.400
took off rapidly.

224
20:08.240 --> 20:09.160
In less than a year,

225
20:09.319 --> 20:12.799
the board appointed me CEO.

226
20:13.039 --> 20:15.119
Long Zhiyuan, chairman of Longze Group,

227
20:15.799 --> 20:16.960
spent most of his time overseas.

228
20:17.119 --> 20:18.640
So I took advantage of that opportunity

229
20:18.799 --> 20:20.839
to win over people in every department,

230
20:21.359 --> 20:24.480
taking sole control of Longze Group.

231
20:25.119 --> 20:29.720
A year ago, I brought Chen Hai on board,

232
20:30.079 --> 20:33.000
and through him, made contact with

233
20:33.480 --> 20:35.079
senior executives at Zhongtian Logistics.

234
20:35.400 --> 20:38.599
Through Zhongtian Logistics and Longze,

235
20:39.200 --> 20:41.160
Cheng Weimin and I built

236
20:41.319 --> 20:45.359
a sales, transit, and laundering network.

237
20:48.519 --> 20:49.599
I originally thought

238
20:49.599 --> 20:51.599
our setup was completely foolproof.

239
20:52.640 --> 20:53.759
Little did I expect

240
20:54.680 --> 20:57.160
that once Xiangdu Club was raided,

241
20:58.039 --> 21:00.119
every single link in our drug ring

242
21:01.039 --> 21:03.640
would be crushed by you one by one.

243
21:05.799 --> 21:06.960
According to what you've said,

244
21:08.519 --> 21:13.319
Wu Liang, Li Qiang, Xiao Yunfei,

245
21:13.799 --> 21:15.559
Ma Jingrong, Qian Feng, Four-Legged Snake,

246
21:16.680 --> 21:20.400
were pawns across your drug network.

247
21:22.160 --> 21:23.319
You're right.

248
21:24.880 --> 21:27.799
The mastermind you've been looking for

249
21:28.279 --> 21:29.400
is me.

250
21:30.200 --> 21:33.279
After Wu Liang was investigated by us,

251
21:34.160 --> 21:37.039
were you also behind

252
21:38.039 --> 21:38.720
those multiple contract killings?

253
21:40.720 --> 21:43.079
The drugs sold through my hands

254
21:43.759 --> 21:45.559
are enough to get me executed many times.

255
21:46.039 --> 21:49.359
With a few more homicides on my hands,

256
21:49.680 --> 21:51.400
what difference does it really make?

257
21:55.079 --> 21:56.079
So you're saying

258
21:56.599 --> 22:01.839
you masterminded all of these cases?

259
22:04.759 --> 22:06.160
Then who is Chameleon?

260
22:08.319 --> 22:09.640
And what is your connection

261
22:09.680 --> 22:11.079
to Piyazi from Jiechan State?

262
22:14.279 --> 22:17.200
I am the one you've been after all along:

263
22:18.640 --> 22:19.960
Chameleon.

264
22:23.720 --> 22:25.200
As for Piyazi,

265
22:26.359 --> 22:27.640
our relationship

266
22:28.000 --> 22:30.079
is purely buyer and seller, nothing more.

267
22:34.599 --> 22:35.640
If this matter

268
22:35.640 --> 22:37.200
were truly as simple as you claim,

269
22:37.480 --> 22:40.480
why would Xiang Nan need

270
22:40.799 --> 22:42.119
to hunt down Cheng Weimin to silence him?

271
22:43.480 --> 22:45.039
Cheng Weimin was compromised.

272
22:46.160 --> 22:48.599
I asked Piyazi to eliminate Cheng Weimin.

273
22:48.799 --> 22:52.480
The moment Cheng Weimin was caught

274
22:52.480 --> 22:53.400
by the Jiangyang police,

275
22:53.960 --> 22:55.880
I knew the game was up.

276
22:58.000 --> 22:59.799
Now that you have me in custody,

277
23:01.039 --> 23:03.319
should I congratulate you

278
23:04.480 --> 23:05.720
on your major triumph?

279
23:09.559 --> 23:11.079
We didn't catch you.

280
23:12.559 --> 23:14.720
You walked right into our net.

281
23:17.640 --> 23:19.400
There's one thing I don't understand.

282
23:19.839 --> 23:21.400
Why didn't you flee today?

283
23:26.759 --> 23:27.960
Life...

284
23:29.279 --> 23:31.000
is like a gamble.

285
23:31.279 --> 23:32.359
When you lose,

286
23:33.559 --> 23:34.559
you have to accept it.

287
23:40.319 --> 23:42.759
You had been preparing to flee all along,

288
23:43.559 --> 23:45.319
but at the critical moment,

289
23:46.599 --> 23:47.799
you chose to turn yourself in.

290
23:48.119 --> 23:50.720
Don't you think your explanations

291
23:52.279 --> 23:53.640
are a bit too far-fetched?

292
23:58.559 --> 24:00.519
There are many things

293
24:02.279 --> 24:04.759
that only at the very last moment

294
24:06.240 --> 24:08.079
can one truly figure out.

295
24:09.319 --> 24:11.680
Did we check the phones he used?

296
24:12.759 --> 24:14.839
Jiang Shan regularly used three phones.

297
24:14.920 --> 24:16.480
One was used exclusively

298
24:16.640 --> 24:17.519
to contact Jiechan State.

299
24:17.720 --> 24:19.000
The one found in his office

300
24:19.359 --> 24:20.720
was his regular work phone.

301
24:21.079 --> 24:22.400
Right before boarding the plane,

302
24:22.680 --> 24:24.119
he was using a private number.

303
24:24.440 --> 24:25.960
According to Jiang Shan's confession,

304
24:26.039 --> 24:28.359
only his family knew this number.

305
24:28.559 --> 24:29.839
Before the plane took off,

306
24:29.960 --> 24:32.279
he received an international call.

307
24:32.440 --> 24:33.559
His daughter is studying abroad.

308
24:33.720 --> 24:36.519
The call was likely from her.

309
24:40.680 --> 24:43.920
Touched by family, his conscience awoke,

310
24:45.680 --> 24:49.440
and he chose to turn good before dying?

311
24:51.240 --> 24:54.119
Do you think that would happen to

312
24:54.200 --> 24:56.519
a cold-blooded killer?

313
24:59.680 --> 25:03.559
I know you find it hard to believe me,

314
25:04.880 --> 25:09.000
but that's all I have to confess.

315
25:10.680 --> 25:13.920
I hope for a suspended death sentence

316
25:14.759 --> 25:18.720
so I can see my family a few more times.

317
25:21.839 --> 25:22.920
Jiang Shan turning himself in

318
25:23.559 --> 25:25.119
not only exposed Zhongtian Logistics

319
25:25.240 --> 25:27.000
and many executives at Longze Group,

320
25:27.319 --> 25:29.599
but also gave us the movements

321
25:29.759 --> 25:30.880
of drug dealers active in Nanhai.

322
25:32.240 --> 25:34.440
Ever since the Xiangdu Club drug case,

323
25:34.440 --> 25:36.000
our Operation Thunderbolt

324
25:36.200 --> 25:38.960
has achieved significant breakthroughs.

325
25:40.119 --> 25:40.680
Moving forward,

326
25:41.279 --> 25:43.839
the narcotics squad, backed by detectives,

327
25:44.240 --> 25:47.200
must round up all traffickers tied to him

328
25:47.359 --> 25:48.160
and crush their criminal activities,

329
25:48.319 --> 25:50.119
scouring every corner of society

330
25:50.160 --> 25:51.039
to sweep away the toxic filth

331
25:51.440 --> 25:53.119
once and for all.

332
25:54.559 --> 25:55.000
Chief,

333
25:55.400 --> 25:56.759
I believe Jiang Shan's surrender

334
25:57.000 --> 25:57.799
still raises a lot of doubts.

335
25:58.359 --> 25:59.960
Besides, between him and Piyazi,

336
26:00.519 --> 26:02.400
it's not just a buyer-seller relationship.

337
26:02.599 --> 26:02.960
Right.

338
26:04.279 --> 26:05.880
Although we have achieved

339
26:06.079 --> 26:06.839
significant results,

340
26:06.920 --> 26:08.400
this isn't the final victory yet.

341
26:09.160 --> 26:10.599
The higher-ups share our view.

342
26:11.240 --> 26:12.359
So far,

343
26:13.279 --> 26:14.559
our suspicions regarding Jiang Shan

344
26:14.759 --> 26:16.079
lack sufficient evidence

345
26:16.359 --> 26:17.079
and solid leads.

346
26:17.839 --> 26:18.680
So moving forward,

347
26:19.440 --> 26:21.480
we must meticulously and patiently

348
26:21.880 --> 26:25.000
find more discrepancies in his statement.

349
26:26.039 --> 26:27.559
In addition, our overseas officers

350
26:27.920 --> 26:29.359
have also obtained

351
26:29.880 --> 26:31.960
plenty of evidence and leads from Piyazi.

352
26:33.079 --> 26:35.440
I believe that with enough patience,

353
26:35.960 --> 26:38.000
we will secure the final victory.

354
26:42.400 --> 26:44.079
Behind all our victories

355
26:44.960 --> 26:46.279
lies the selfless dedication

356
26:46.480 --> 26:48.079
of every single officer,

357
26:48.200 --> 26:49.279
and even their ultimate sacrifice.

358
26:50.720 --> 26:52.000
We must inherit

359
26:52.160 --> 26:53.240
this spirit of selfless devotion

360
26:53.640 --> 26:55.079
and carry it forward.

361
27:25.920 --> 27:28.200
You unfilial son...

362
27:30.359 --> 27:32.960
making a parent bury their child!

363
27:34.279 --> 27:37.359
You unfilial son!

364
27:37.440 --> 27:40.079
Why did you leave before me?

365
27:43.960 --> 27:47.440
Why did you have to go first?

366
28:08.920 --> 28:11.039
You're still so young.

367
28:14.079 --> 28:16.759
So young...

368
28:20.160 --> 28:21.480
Wake up!

369
28:25.400 --> 28:27.759
Wake up!

370
28:36.839 --> 28:38.799
Please, wake up!

371
29:01.200 --> 29:02.480
Look at that clinic up ahead.

372
29:03.079 --> 29:04.920
It's run by a doctor named Chen Heren.

373
29:05.799 --> 29:08.559
Whenever Piyazi's men get injured,

374
29:09.160 --> 29:10.759
they always come here for treatment.

375
29:13.960 --> 29:14.599
So that means

376
29:15.880 --> 29:17.799
this Dr. Chen works for Piyazi too.

377
29:35.920 --> 29:36.720
Not necessarily.

378
29:37.200 --> 29:38.279
From what the locals say,

379
29:38.640 --> 29:40.960
Chen Heren treats the villagers very well.

380
29:41.359 --> 29:42.960
Piyazi offered top dollar back then

381
29:42.960 --> 29:45.000
to move his clinic into the base,

382
29:45.079 --> 29:46.960
but for the sake of the local residents,

383
29:47.000 --> 29:48.000
Chen Heren chose to stay behind.

384
30:08.920 --> 30:09.599
Where are you going?

385
30:10.839 --> 30:12.279
Going inside to check things out.

386
30:13.720 --> 30:15.200
All right, be careful.

387
30:16.440 --> 30:17.079
Don't worry.

388
31:49.839 --> 31:50.880
You're coughing so badly.

389
31:51.440 --> 31:52.200
Come here, let me listen.

390
32:09.759 --> 32:11.119
Open your mouth. Let me see.

391
32:17.200 --> 32:18.880
It may not look serious now,

392
32:19.319 --> 32:22.400
but if you'd waited two more days,

393
32:24.079 --> 32:26.400
things could've gotten bad.

394
32:30.680 --> 32:32.359
I'll prescribe two days of medicine first.

395
32:32.880 --> 32:35.279
If there's no improvement after taking it,

396
32:36.039 --> 32:36.960
come back to see me.

397
32:44.200 --> 32:45.920
Go downstairs to pick up your medicine.

398
32:59.680 --> 33:00.960
Sir, please wait over there for a moment.

399
33:07.640 --> 33:08.559
Sir, here is your medication.

400
33:23.359 --> 33:26.559
Honey, what took you so long?

401
33:26.640 --> 33:28.720
Sorry, I had a bit of a cough.

402
33:28.880 --> 33:29.359
Let's go.

403
33:38.960 --> 33:41.839
Thanks, boss. Bye!

404
33:43.160 --> 33:43.680
Get in.

405
33:55.279 --> 33:56.720
Who was that woman just now?

406
33:57.119 --> 33:58.400
A dancer in town.

407
33:58.640 --> 33:59.799
I was worried they'd hurt you,

408
34:00.200 --> 34:01.319
so I staged that scene on purpose.

409
34:01.559 --> 34:02.920
Good thing you reacted fast.

410
34:04.480 --> 34:05.119
Thanks.

411
34:05.920 --> 34:09.719
Though this pack of medicine wasn't cheap.

412
34:10.280 --> 34:11.079
Wasn't cheap, huh?

413
34:11.480 --> 34:11.920
By the way,

414
34:12.440 --> 34:14.679
how's the situation at the clinic?

415
34:14.840 --> 34:15.679
Did you scope it out?

416
34:16.800 --> 34:18.119
There are five men outside the clinic,

417
34:18.320 --> 34:19.360
and two inside.

418
34:19.519 --> 34:20.840
The layout isn't too complicated,

419
34:20.920 --> 34:22.000
so pulling off the rescue

420
34:22.039 --> 34:22.920
shouldn't be too difficult.

421
34:23.800 --> 34:24.960
Still, we need to hurry,

422
34:25.159 --> 34:25.960
because in a few days,

423
34:26.440 --> 34:27.840
the situation could change.

424
34:31.800 --> 34:33.199
When I was at the clinic earlier,

425
34:33.480 --> 34:34.880
Piyazi's men grew suspicious of me.

426
34:35.119 --> 34:36.480
Dr. Chen covered for me,

427
34:36.679 --> 34:39.280
and while examining me, he warned me

428
34:39.679 --> 34:40.840
that rescuing Professor Du

429
34:41.280 --> 34:42.519
has to happen in the next couple of days.

430
34:42.840 --> 34:44.400
How is Professor Du doing?

431
34:45.880 --> 34:46.880
He's recovering pretty well.

432
34:48.920 --> 34:50.159
That's great, then.

433
34:50.159 --> 34:50.760
Here's the plan.

434
34:51.079 --> 34:52.239
You stay here

435
34:52.280 --> 34:54.360
and meet the Chinese special ops team

436
34:54.360 --> 34:55.400
to rescue Professor Du.

437
34:55.480 --> 34:56.039
What do you think?

438
34:56.679 --> 34:58.360
Me staying here to meet up with them

439
34:59.840 --> 35:00.760
sounds like the best idea.

440
35:01.199 --> 35:02.360
Then there's nothing left for me to do.

441
35:02.480 --> 35:03.519
I'll head back to Country M right away

442
35:03.679 --> 35:05.400
to follow up on rescuing Tian Xin.

443
35:06.039 --> 35:06.840
Inspector Mai,

444
35:07.840 --> 35:10.800
any word on Li Qiang and Tian Xin?

445
35:11.639 --> 35:13.239
I just received today's intel.

446
35:13.400 --> 35:14.679
Early this morning, Qin Mu

447
35:14.719 --> 35:15.800
had Li Qiang moved into

448
35:15.880 --> 35:17.320
the Four Seasons Hotel in Country M.

449
35:17.599 --> 35:18.800
I've already shared this development

450
35:18.920 --> 35:20.559
with the police in Country M.

451
35:20.679 --> 35:22.039
I'm sure they've dispatched officers

452
35:22.039 --> 35:23.000
to stake out the place.

453
35:23.159 --> 35:24.679
Tonight, Captain Rosen and I

454
35:24.840 --> 35:26.159
will launch an arrest operation together.

455
35:26.280 --> 35:27.119
Once the operation is over,

456
35:27.280 --> 35:28.440
I'll let you know right away.

457
35:30.519 --> 35:31.039
Thank you.

458
35:32.159 --> 35:33.000
All right, let's go.

459
35:42.880 --> 35:43.519
Come on.

460
35:55.079 --> 35:56.119
Things are good now.

461
35:56.360 --> 35:58.159
My brother is coming to Country M soon.

462
35:58.400 --> 36:00.880
We can finally settle down.

463
36:10.159 --> 36:12.000
I know you won't love me,

464
36:12.760 --> 36:13.960
but I believe

465
36:14.519 --> 36:15.920
I can make you happy.

466
36:21.280 --> 36:23.320
Happiness can never be forced.

467
36:25.599 --> 36:27.559
Don't you understand something so simple?

468
36:28.320 --> 36:29.840
You're ridiculous.

469
36:36.480 --> 36:37.599
Time to eat.

470
36:39.519 --> 36:41.880
I heard the food at this hotel is great.

471
36:43.320 --> 36:44.119
What would you like?

472
36:44.519 --> 36:45.599
I'll have them bring it up.

473
36:47.280 --> 36:48.719
I don't want to eat anything from here.

474
37:13.480 --> 37:15.119
Then I'll go get you some in Chinatown.

475
37:16.639 --> 37:17.559
What do you want to eat?

476
37:19.159 --> 37:20.239
How about Chinese food?

477
37:24.880 --> 37:25.800
Wait for me here.

478
37:27.000 --> 37:28.079
I'll be right back.

479
38:12.119 --> 38:12.840
Wait for me.

480
38:52.440 --> 38:52.960
Hello.

481
38:54.039 --> 38:54.639
Could you tell me,

482
38:54.800 --> 38:55.719
is there a Chinese restaurant around here?

483
38:56.079 --> 38:58.199
Turn right outside and walk two blocks.

484
38:58.719 --> 38:59.519
Thanks a lot.

485
40:19.440 --> 40:20.480
How's it looking? What's the situation?

486
40:20.639 --> 40:22.559
Qin Mu's men have all left.

487
40:22.719 --> 40:25.480
Only the suspect and hostage are inside.

488
40:26.400 --> 40:27.760
Let's move. Follow me to make the arrest.

489
40:28.199 --> 40:29.280
Make sure to protect the hostage.

490
40:29.280 --> 40:29.960
Yes, sir!

491
40:59.760 --> 41:02.039
Hello, room service.

492
41:03.159 --> 41:05.559
Hello, room service.

493
41:37.480 --> 41:38.320
He got away!

494
42:45.320 --> 42:46.880
Jiangyang Brigade, Li Xiaodong.

495
42:50.239 --> 42:51.239
Thanks for coming, Captain Li.

496
42:51.519 --> 42:52.800
You're the commander of this operation.

497
42:53.000 --> 42:53.840
I should be calling you Captain.

498
43:01.320 --> 43:02.440
We checked the surveillance footage.

499
43:02.760 --> 43:04.039
The suspect left this afternoon

500
43:04.039 --> 43:06.519
from the parking lot downstairs.

501
43:07.760 --> 43:10.039
Have the team search the surrounding area.

502
43:10.079 --> 43:11.079
Apprehend the suspect as soon as possible.

503
43:11.599 --> 43:12.159
Yes, sir.

504
43:16.159 --> 43:17.199
Higher-ups only told me

505
43:17.679 --> 43:20.079
we were just after an illegal immigrant.

506
43:20.880 --> 43:21.880
But now it looks like

507
43:22.239 --> 43:23.280
there's more to this guy.

508
43:24.639 --> 43:25.639
You're right.

509
43:26.000 --> 43:27.880
We have real trouble on our hands.
